n: center;\n      padding-top: 11px;\n    }\n    .heading .main-title {\n      font-size: 28px;\n      line-height: 1.15;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    }\n    .heading .chapter-line {\n      position: relative;\n      margin-top: 10px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      font-size: 27px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n    .heading .author {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 7px;\n      bottom: 0;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n    .maker {\n      width: 483px;\n      margin: 1px auto 0;\n      text-align: right;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 15px;\n    }\n    .quote {\n      width: 486px;\n      height: 45px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 10px 5px;\n      border-radius: 7px;\n      background: rgba(147,197,119,.46);\n      color: #a12017;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      display: table;\n      margin: 28px auto 31px;\n      padding: 4px 7px;\n      background: rgba(160,202,127,.24);\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n    .content {\n      width: 490px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.95;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .highlight {\n      display: table;\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      padding: 2px 4px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      background: rgba(143,193,111,.35);\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    .item {\n      padding-left: 16px;\n      text-indent: -16px;\n      margin: 4px 0;\n    }\n    .item.wrap {\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n    }\n    .subsection {\n      margin-top: 6px;\n    }\n    .subsection .highlight {\n      margin-bottom: 7px;\n    }\n    .closing {\n      margin: 12px 0 0 16px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n    .signature {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 30px;\n      bottom: 13px;\n      color: rgba(46,77,41,.58);\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"book\" aria-label=\"《乡土中国》书封\">\n      <div class=\"small\">乡土中国</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"title\">乡土中国</div>\n      <div class=\"seal\"></div>\n      <div class=\"small\">费孝通</div>\n      <div class=\"bottom\">生活·读书·新知三联书店</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <header class=\"heading\">\n      <div class=\"main-title\">《乡土中国》</div>\n      <div class=\"chapter-line\">\n        第一章 乡土本色\n        <span class=\"author\">作者||费孝通</span>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"maker\">制图by 邵未</div>\n\n    <div class=\"quote\">从基层上看去，中国社会是乡土性的。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">一、乡下人离不了泥土</div>\n\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"highlight\">1.种地是最普通的谋生办法。</div>\n\n      <div class=\"item\">(1) 三条大河的流域已经全是农业区。</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">(2) 迁移到四周边地上去的子弟，也都是很忠实地守着这直接向土里去讨生活的传统。</div>\n      <div class=\"item wrap\">(3) 美国朋友发问：你们中原去的人，到了这最适宜于放牧的草原上，依旧圈地撒种，一家家划着<br>小小的一方地，种植起来，真像是向土里一钻，看不到其他利用这片地的办法了。</div>\n      <div class=\"item wrap\">(4) 有些新闻报道发生有记载：现在西伯利亚，中国人住下了，不管天气如何，还是要下些种子，<br>试试看能不能种地。</div>\n\n      <div class=\"subsection\">\n        <div class=\"highlight\">2.靠种地谋生的人才明白泥土的可贵。“土”是他们的命根。</div>\n        <div class=\"item\">(1) “土地”这位最近于人性的神，象征着可贵的泥土。</div>\n        <div class=\"item\">(2) 我初次出国时，奶妈偷偷把一包用红纸裹着的泥土塞在我箱子底下。</div>\n        <div class=\"item\">(3) 电影里看到东欧农业国家的激进也有着类似的风俗。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"subsection\">\n        <div class=\"highlight\">3.农业是直接取资于土地上的。</div>\n        <div class=\"closing\">与游牧业和工业相比：种地的人搬不动地，土里的庄稼行动不得。（对比论证）</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"signature\">@邵未</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
